/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 92 0 R
/T (Conventional speed tests measure peak throughput under idle conditions, overlooking loaded latency, jitter, and packet loss across fiber, 5G, and satellite networks. Consequently, users experience lag and interruptions despite high bandwidth, leading to misdiagnosed faults, consumer frustration, and ineffective troubleshooting.)
/E (Conventional speed tests measure peak throughput under idle conditions, overlooking loaded latency, jitter, and packet loss across fiber, 5G, and satellite networks. Consequently, users experience lag and interruptions despite high bandwidth, leading to misdiagnosed faults, consumer frustration, and ineffective troubleshooting.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
