/P 874 0 R
/T (Failure Domain Blindness \(Wi-Fi vs. ISP\): Standard tests measure end-to-end performance in one shot, which intern cannot distinguish local Wi-Fi issues from ISP or last-mile failures.)
/E (Failure Domain Blindness \(Wi-Fi vs. ISP\): Standard tests measure end-to-end performance in one shot, which intern cannot distinguish local Wi-Fi issues from ISP or last-mile failures.)
/Pg 11 0 R
