/P 875 0 R
/T (Metric Mismatch: Tests focus almost entirely on peak throughput, completely ignoring the metrics that dictate app stability: DNS resolution time, packet loss, and loaded jitter.)
/E (Metric Mismatch: Tests focus almost entirely on peak throughput, completely ignoring the metrics that dictate app stability: DNS resolution time, packet loss, and loaded jitter.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
